msgid "Build pages visually while Minn protects Breakdance-owned content and links straight to its builder. Download the plugin .zip from Breakdance."
msgstr "Buat halaman secara visual sementara Minn melindungi konten milik Breakdance dan menautkan langsung ke pembuatnya. Unduh plugin .zip dari Breakdance."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:8929
msgid "Build forms and manage their entries, notifications, feeds, and daily settings in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from your Gravity account."
msgstr "Buat formulir dan kelola entri, notifikasi, feed, dan pengaturan hariannya di Minn. Unduh plugin .zip dari akun Gravity Anda."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:8941
msgid "Send and track WordPress email through the full Email surface in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from a qualifying Gravity account."
msgstr "Kirim dan lacak email WordPress melalui seluruh permukaan Email di Minn. Unduh plugin .zip dari akun Gravity yang memenuhi syarat."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:8953
msgid "Manage the Perfmatters settings estate from Minn's Performance surface. Download the paid plugin .zip from Perfmatters."
msgstr "Kelola pengaturan Perfmatters dari permukaan Performa Minn. Unduh plugin berbayar .zip dari Perfmatters."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:8965
msgid "Bring ACF PRO repeaters, flexible content, galleries, options pages, blocks, and field groups into Minn. Download the plugin .zip from ACF."
msgstr "Bawa ACF PRO repeater, konten fleksibel, galeri, halaman opsi, blok, dan grup bidang ke Minn. Unduh plugin .zip dari ACF."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:8977
msgid "Manage Elementor form submissions in Minn while keeping Elementor-owned page content protected. Download the plugin .zip from Elementor."
msgstr "Kelola pengiriman formulir Elementor di Minn sambil menjaga konten halaman milik Elementor tetap terlindungi. Unduh plugin .zip dari Elementor."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:8989
msgid "Manage WPForms Pro entries, read and starred state, spam, trash, search, and form filters in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from WPForms."
msgstr "Kelola entri WPForms Pro, status baca dan bintangi, spam, sampah, pencarian, dan filter formulir di Minn. Unduh plugin .zip dari WPForms."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:9001
msgid "Clear WP Rocket caches from Minn and monitor its license alongside other paid components. Download the plugin .zip from WP Rocket."
msgstr "Hapus cache WP Rocket dari Minn dan pantau lisensinya bersama komponen berbayar lainnya. Unduh plugin .zip dari WP Rocket."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:9013
msgid "Feed AnalyticsWP traffic and drill-down data into Minn's Overview. Download the paid plugin .zip from AnalyticsWP."
msgstr "Masukkan lalu lintas AnalyticsWP dan data penelusuran ke Ikhtisar Minn. Unduh plugin berbayar .zip dari AnalyticsWP."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:9025
msgid "Sell recurring products and services with WooCommerce. This paid extension is installed by uploading the .zip downloaded from WooCommerce.com."
msgstr "Jual produk dan layanan berulang dengan WooCommerce. Ekstensi berbayar ini dipasang dengan mengunggah .zip yang diunduh dari WooCommerce.com."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:9037
msgid "Sell memberships that unlock restricted content, products and discounts. This paid extension is installed by uploading the .zip downloaded from WooCommerce.com."
msgstr "Jual keanggotaan yang membuka konten, produk, dan diskon terbatas. Ekstensi berbayar ini dipasang dengan mengunggah berkas .zip yang diunduh dari WooCommerce.com."

